        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><span class=\"disambig-for noexcerpt\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><i>For this character's appearance in <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfang_Keep\" title=\"Shadowfang Keep\">Shadowfang Keep</a>, see <a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury_(tactics)\" title=\"Baron Ashbury (tactics)\">Baron Ashbury (tactics)</a>.</i></span></dd></dl>\n<table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mob\" title=\"Mob\"><img alt=\"Mob\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Combat 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Combat_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c1/Combat_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20151213203709\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Baron Ashbury</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/e7/Poison_Tipped_TCG.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150907165123\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Baron Ashbury\"><img alt=\"Image of Baron Ashbury\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"157\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Poison Tipped TCG.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Poison_Tipped_TCG.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/e7/Poison_Tipped_TCG.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20150907165123\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken\" title=\"Forsaken\">Forsaken</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Class</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">Priest</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Horde</span></a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Alliance</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\"><span class=\"rep-hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">Horde</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Godfrey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lord Godfrey\">Lord Godfrey</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Former affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_(faction)\" title=\"Undercity (faction)\">Undercity</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Horde\" title=\"Horde\">Horde</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"#Locations\">Various</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased (lore)<br />Killable</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Relative(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Ashbury_the_1st\" title=\"Lord Ashbury the 1st\">Lord Ashbury the 1st</a> (Father)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Baron Ashbury</b> was an eastern nobleman from <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(kingdom)\" title=\"Gilneas (kingdom)\">Gilneas</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Lord_of_His_Pack\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Lord of His Pack</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Curse_of_the_Worgen\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Curse of the Worgen</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Cataclysm\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cataclysm</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Quests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Objective_of\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objective of</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Patch_changes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Patch changes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/27/Baron_Ashbury.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20151105192119\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baron Ashbury (Alive)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"264\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Baron Ashbury.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Ashbury.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/27/Baron_Ashbury.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20151105192119\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/27/Baron_Ashbury.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20151105192119\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baron Ashbury (Alive)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/27/Baron_Ashbury.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20151105192119\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"264\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Baron Ashbury.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Ashbury.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/27/Baron_Ashbury.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20151105192119\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Baron_Ashbury.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Baron Ashbury (Alive)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lord_of_His_Pack\">Lord of His Pack</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Novels\" title=\"Novels\"><img alt=\"WoW-novel-logo-16x62\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WoW-novel-logo-16x62.png\" data-image-key=\"WoW-novel-logo-16x62.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/d/d0/WoW-novel-logo-16x62.png/revision/latest?cb=20080902025649\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to the <i>Warcraft</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Novels\" title=\"Novels\">novels</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Novellas\" title=\"Novellas\">novellas</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Short_stories\" title=\"Short stories\">short stories</a>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>He and <a href=\"/wiki/Genn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Genn\">Genn</a> grew up together, and he was once one of the king's most trusted friends. He was present in the <a href=\"/wiki/Capital_City\" title=\"Capital City\">Capital City</a> to create the <a href=\"/wiki/Alliance_of_Lordaeron\" title=\"Alliance of Lordaeron\">Alliance of Lordaeron</a> and agreed with <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Godfrey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lord Godfrey\">Lord Godfrey</a>, to send only a token army. He participated in the hunts with Genn, <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Marley\" title=\"Lord Marley\">Lord Marley</a> and Godfrey in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blackwald\" title=\"Blackwald\">Blackwald</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Curse_of_the_Worgen\">Curse of the Worgen</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Comics\" title=\"Comics\"><img alt=\"Comics title\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Comics title.png\" data-image-key=\"Comics_title.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/98/Comics_title.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/57?cb=20180928143648\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to the <i>Warcraft</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Manga\" title=\"Manga\">manga</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Comics\" title=\"Comics\">comics</a>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>One day before the attack on <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a>, he quarreled with <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Walden\" title=\"Lord Walden\">Lord Walden</a> because of the bad situation in Gilneas especially the shortage of livestock.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cataclysm\">Cataclysm</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"vertical-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 32px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <span class=\"greybar\" style=\"font-size: 0.85em; padding: 0 0.2em;\"><b>This section concerns content related to <i><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"World of Warcraft: Cataclysm\">Cataclysm</a></i>.</b></span></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<p>He joined with Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Vincent_Godfrey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vincent Godfrey\">Vincent Godfrey</a> to turn <a href=\"/wiki/Genn_Greymane\" title=\"Genn Greymane\">Genn Greymane</a> over to the <a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken\" title=\"Forsaken\">Forsaken</a> in exchange for an end to hostilities. Along with his ally, <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Walden\" title=\"Lord Walden\">Lord Walden</a>, Ashbury was slain by Gilnean <a href=\"/wiki/Worgen\" title=\"Worgen\">worgen</a> who fought to save their King. Godfrey, Ashbury, and Walden were all raised in undeath by the Forsaken and served them for a time. After Godfrey betrayed the Forsaken by slaying <a href=\"/wiki/Sylvanas_Windrunner\" title=\"Sylvanas Windrunner\">Sylvanas Windrunner</a>, Ashbury fled with his master into nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowfang_Keep\" title=\"Shadowfang Keep\">Shadowfang Keep</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"darktable\" style=\"float: ; width: 35em; margin: 0 0 20px 10px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center; padding: 5px; font-size: 110%;\" colspan=\"3\">Notable appearances\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>Level range</th>\n<th>Health range\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas City</a>\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>169\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"alt\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest\" title=\"Silverpine Forest\">Silverpine Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>3,860\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest\" title=\"Silverpine Forest\">Silverpine Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>4,410\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"alt\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silverpine_Forest\" title=\"Silverpine Forest\">Silverpine Forest</a>\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>2,646\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quests\">Quests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"H\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Horde 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Horde_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/c/c4/Horde_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20201010153315\" /></span></span>&#160;[5-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Of_No_Consequence\" title=\"Of No Consequence\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Of No Consequence</span></a></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Availablequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Availablequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Availablequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/5/51/Availablequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020020\" /></a></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Identifying_quest_givers\" title=\"Quest\"><img alt=\"Activequest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-image-key=\"Activequesticon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/a/ab/Activequesticon.png/revision/latest?cb=20070607020008\" /></a></span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective_of\">Objective of</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"A\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/21/Alliance_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110509070714\" /></span></span>&#160;<span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520012351\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Male\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"IconSmall Worgen Male.gif\" data-image-key=\"IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520012351\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/64/IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520022309\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Female\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"IconSmall Worgen Female.gif\" data-image-key=\"IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/64/IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520022309\" /></a></span></span>&#160;[1-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Betrayal_at_Tempest%27s_Reach\" title=\"Betrayal at Tempest&#39;s Reach\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Betrayal at Tempest's Reach</span></a></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On his undeath:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"text-say\">I always loved Silverpine -- until the Lich King let loose his rampaging <a href=\"/wiki/Scourge\" title=\"Scourge\">Scourge</a> armies and turned the land into a rotting corpse pit. Now the sight of it boils my green blood.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">This is undoubtedly Godfrey's fault.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">They should have burned my damned corpse.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">Keep the conversations curt. I am in no mood for whining or rambling.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">Being forsaken has its benefits. Let me see... I am able to practically live underwater. I can stay submerged 233% longer than any fleshy mortal. Yes, count it, 233%.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">Oh, and now I am able to shrug off mind-controlling effects - BECAUSE I LACK A BRAIN!</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">And perhaps the best part, I now have a hungering for the flesh of other humanoids. Cannibalizing their rotten corpses grants me power. Yes, DE-LI-CIOUS...</span></li></ul>\n<p>Random dialogue with Godfrey:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"text-say\">Lord Godfrey says: For pity's sake Ashbury, cover yourself. Your leg bones are popping out.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"text-say\">Baron Ashbury says: I did not bring this wretched affliction upon myself, Godfrey, it was a \"gift,\" remember? Now kindly enjoy the gift and shut up.</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Oddly, as a Forsaken Ashbury has hair, but at the time of his death he was bald.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/0/0d/Baron_Ashbury_CoTW.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180820140325\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Baron Ashbury during Curse of the Worgen.\"><img alt=\"Baron Ashbury during Curse of the Worgen.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/0/0d/Baron_Ashbury_CoTW.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/93?cb=20180820140325\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"93\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baron Ashbury CoTW.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Ashbury_CoTW.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Baron Ashbury during <a href=\"/wiki/Curse_of_the_Worgen\" title=\"Curse of the Worgen\">Curse of the Worgen</a>.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/90/Baron_Ashbury_Forsaken.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111015022828\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ashbury when first raised\"><img alt=\"Ashbury when first raised\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/9/90/Baron_Ashbury_Forsaken.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/77?cb=20111015022828\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"77\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baron Ashbury Forsaken.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Ashbury_Forsaken.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ashbury when first raised</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/4/4e/Baron_Ashbury_Forsaken2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20111015022828\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ashbury in his new outfit\"><img alt=\"Ashbury in his new outfit\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/4/4e/Baron_Ashbury_Forsaken2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20111015022828\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baron Ashbury Forsaken2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Ashbury_Forsaken2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ashbury in his new outfit</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6b/Baron_Ashbury_TCG.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210401002249\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ashbury in the TCG.\"><img alt=\"Ashbury in the TCG.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"95\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Baron Ashbury TCG.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Baron_Ashbury_TCG.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6b/Baron_Ashbury_TCG.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20210401002249\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ashbury in the TCG.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.0.3a\" title=\"Patch 4.0.3a\">Patch 4.0.3a</a> (2010-11-23):</b> Added.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury_(TCG_Shadowfang_Keep)\" title=\"Baron Ashbury (TCG Shadowfang Keep)\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink\">Baron Ashbury</span></a>, TCG card</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:calc(80% + 